# Mapperatorinator Project Context

## What This Project Does
Multi-model framework for generating osu! beatmaps from audio. Uses spectrogram inputs → osuT5 (transformer) → osu-diffusion for coordinate refinement.

## Tech Stack
- **Python 3.10** (later versions may break dependencies)
- **PyTorch** (CUDA/ROCm/MPS)
- **Hydra** for config (use override syntax: `key=value`)
- **slider** (osu! beatmap parsing)
- **transformers** (Whisper-derived encoder)

## Key Entry Points
- `inference.py` — beatmap generation
- `web-ui.py` — GUI for inference
- `mai_mod.py` / `mai_mod_ui.py` — AI modding tool
- `osuT5/train.py` — model training
- `osu_diffusion/train.py` — diffusion training

## Important Paths
- `configs/` — Hydra YAML configs (inference, train, model)
- `osuT5/` — Main transformer model, tokenizer, inference pipeline
- `osu_diffusion/` — Diffusion for position refinement
- `classifier/` — Beatmap classifier
- `rcomplexion/` — Additional model components

## Config Convention
Use `config.py` dataclasses (`InferenceConfig`, etc.) as source of truth. YAML configs override defaults via Hydra.
